{"uid":"912bf7e9d5a4835e","name":"test_set_job_deadline_emits_an_event_distinguishable_from_infra_extension","fullName":"tests.test_cli_features#test_set_job_deadline_emits_an_event_distinguishable_from_infra_extension","historyId":"60a8405a6b87000a90c976ff6680c17b","time":{"start":1791866957079,"stop":1791866957083,"duration":4},"description":"An operator-requested deadline change must not be mistaken for an\n    automatic infra-outage extension when read back from `events.jsonl` --\n    `_account_infra_wait` emits `deadline_extended` with `reason=\"infra\n    wait\"`; `set_job_deadline` must emit something else entirely (a\n    different event type, not just a different `reason` on the same type),\n    and must never emit `deadline_extended` itself. `sup.runner` is stubbed\n    even though this setter never touches it, per this module's own rule\n    for anything reached through the supervisor rather than a bare\n    attribute rebind.","descriptionHtml":"<p>An operator-requested deadline change must not be mistaken for an<br />\nautomatic infra-outage extension when read back from <code>events.jsonl</code> --<br />\n<code>_account_infra_wait</code> emits <code>deadline_extended</code> with <code>reason=&quot;infra wait&quot;</code>; <code>set_job_deadline</code> must emit something else entirely (a<br />\ndifferent event type, not just a different <code>reason</code> on the same type),<br />\nand must never emit <code>deadline_extended</code> itself. <code>sup.runner</code> is stubbed<br />\neven though this setter never touches it, per this module's own rule<br />\nfor anything reached through the supervisor rather than a bare<br />\nattribute rebind.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791866910559,"stop":1791866910559,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldD